  unitName: Pixy Royal Leore
  unitId: 30153
  unitNumber: 228
  description: "A young boy who was raised by Titania as a pixy. Upon reaching the
    village he believed his real parents to be in, Leore was ambushed by a regiment
    of gods. He quickly disposed of them, and immediately returned to the faeries\u2019
    grove, where he implored Titania to ready an army. After Leore had told her about
    the gods\u2019 plan for world domination, Titania ordered him to rule over the
    pixy army."
  summonDesc: I was born a human, but raised a pix.<br>Winning this battle is the
    least<br>I could do for them.
  fusionDesc: "Just as the Queen charged me<br>with the pixies\u2019 fate, so you
    too<br>bestow upon me this great power."
  evoDesc: "It is a ruler\u2019s solemn duty to protect<br>and lead those weaker
    than him.<br>I shall refuse no one my assistance."
  element: 3
  rarity: 3
